          <caption>
            <p>Intussusception of Small Bowel. Intussusception occurs when a segment of bowel telescopes into an adjacent segment, causing an obstruction and, in severe cases, intestinal ischemia. Contributed by O&#x000a0;Chaigasame, MD</p>
